  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the chopped leeks, sumac, and olive oil.",
    "Spread the leek mixture on a baking sheet and roast for 20 minutes.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the minced garlic and yogurt.",
    "Warm the pita bread in the oven for 2 minutes.",
    "Assemble the wraps by spreading the garlic yogurt on each piece of pita bread, then topping with roasted leeks, sliced cucumber, and chopped mint.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with additional sumac and mint if desired.",
    "Store any leftovers in the refrigerator for up to 3 days."
